/-- **Instantiated-Diagonal 0-Instantiation Congruence Supply (`Subst0CongrSupplyDSubKClosedCtxBi E n`):**
    Requires ONLY the instantiated left diagonal
    `LRTermDSubKClosedCtxBi E n Γ (instantiate0 v₁ b) (instantiate0 v₁ b) (instantiate0 v₁ B)`
    in `Γ` (rather than the uninstantiated `.letBinding A v₁ :: Γ` diagonal), so that both
    `ConvT.letE` and off-diagonal `ConvT.app` (`f₁ a₁ ~ f₂ a₁ ~ f₂ a₂`) are discharged directly
