      LRTermDSubKClosedCtxSemBi E n Γ v₁ v₂ A →
      LRTermDSubKClosedCtxSemBi E n Γ (instantiate0 v₁ b) (instantiate0 v₁ b) (instantiate0 v₁ B) →
