  · intro hN
    rcases h c hc (Or.inr hN) with hP | hpi | hlr
    · exact (hnoprop hP).elim
    · exact (hnopi hpi).elim
    · exact (approxDIK_of_lrProbeTypePiKClosedCtxMaj hW hlr).1

