/-- Unconditional `LRAppFnMajSemBi` when `instantiate0 a B` is a semantic proposition (`IsSemPropTyI`)
    for every `ha : HasTyT E n Γ a A` (`lrAppFnMajSemBi_of_isSemPropTyI_codomain`). -/
theorem lrAppFnMajSemBi_of_isSemPropTyI_codomain {E : ResolvedEnv} {n : Nat}
